WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.640
--OP--

00:08.400 --> 00:11.330
The Gods of the skies, known as the Heavenly people,

00:12.030 --> 00:16.610
fought a huge war against the humans of the Lower World.

00:19.760 --> 00:24.080
It was a battle fought over the almighty power that can create anything-

00:25.240 --> 00:27.680
the Akuto.

02:12.340 --> 02:15.090
How disgusting!

02:15.260 --> 02:18.110
Those unintelligent beings created something like this.

02:18.640 --> 02:22.210
The Heavenly beings created this combat automaton...

02:22.210 --> 02:24.750
...to suppress the opposing force...

02:25.580 --> 02:31.910
...during the intervention against the Lower World.

02:32.150 --> 02:37.910
This isn't something new created by the United Army, right, Gntarl?

02:38.130 --> 02:40.300
Don't worry.

02:40.300 --> 02:44.210
The Heavenly beings have sealed off their own space-time door.

02:44.210 --> 02:50.510
Ever since that calamitous day, their ability to create was suspended and revoked.

02:50.510 --> 02:54.300
It was found buried in an abandoned Creation Workshop.

02:54.540 --> 02:57.310
Can this foreign object really defeat Munto?

02:58.830 --> 03:00.160
Please look.

03:14.030 --> 03:21.290
Regardless of how strong Munto is, if this automaton attacks him in the Lower World of death...

03:21.290 --> 03:25.860
...devoid of the almighty Akuto, he will not last longer than a few hours.

03:34.820 --> 03:37.740
Are you Suzume's friends, Yumemi and Ichiko?

03:38.780 --> 03:42.260
I see. You girls are Yumemi and Ichiko.

03:42.260 --> 03:44.140
Suzume talks about you two frequently.

03:44.140 --> 03:46.150
She says that you two are her important friends.

03:46.730 --> 03:49.820
Umm, I heard you were going to marry Suzume...

03:53.580 --> 03:54.590
I see.

03:55.100 --> 04:00.790
I guess you're worried about Suzume because of the type of guy I am.

04:00.790 --> 04:02.840
No, that's not it...

04:03.440 --> 04:07.340
You're true friends. Suzume has a right to be proud.

04:07.340 --> 04:09.420
Kazuya-kun, it's a joke, right?

04:11.520 --> 04:13.930
The marriage is no joke.

04:15.740 --> 04:18.470
We're going to get married here tomorrow.

04:19.610 --> 04:22.090
We came to this decision together.

04:23.460 --> 04:24.350
But...

04:24.350 --> 04:26.020
I know the rules of society.

04:26.870 --> 04:29.020
My parents won't allow it, either.

04:29.020 --> 04:30.440
So why?

04:31.130 --> 04:35.240
I've been searching for Suzume's hand for a long time,

04:37.010 --> 04:38.610
a hand which I can hold.

04:39.980 --> 04:43.060
Humans are weak because they cannot do anything on their own.

04:43.920 --> 04:46.380
I've been alone ever since I was small.

04:47.320 --> 04:49.980
I ate with my family only a few times each year.

04:50.620 --> 04:53.320
I was overjoyed on the rare occasions when my mother called home.

04:54.770 --> 04:56.730
I've never held anything against them, though.

04:56.730 --> 04:59.810
They have their own lives to live.

05:00.470 --> 05:04.810
That's why, in order to protect myself, I chose my own path.

05:06.660 --> 05:08.810
I know it's naïve.

05:09.940 --> 05:14.550
Before I knew it, neither my parents nor society needed me anymore.

05:14.550 --> 05:17.740
I didn't know why I was still living.

05:20.670 --> 05:22.640
I stopped caring about everything.

05:23.790 --> 05:25.660
That's why I thought of ending my life.

05:28.540 --> 05:31.520
But on that day, I met Suzume,

05:33.130 --> 05:34.200
and she smiled at me.

05:35.780 --> 05:37.380
It took me by surprise.

05:37.380 --> 05:39.270
Everything changed from that moment onward.

05:39.960 --> 05:42.910
Both myself and the way I saw the world.

05:47.540 --> 05:51.430
Then she held my hand.

05:52.840 --> 05:56.470
After that, she came here every day just to see me.

05:57.240 --> 06:00.240
You might think it's funny, but she was trying to protect me.

06:01.870 --> 06:05.590
I'd been searching long and hard for a hand to hold.

06:06.460 --> 06:07.560
Her hand.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.800
But getting married...

06:12.560 --> 06:15.850
It's just Suzume and I standing on the same place.

06:15.850 --> 06:18.040
It's not living together.

06:18.040 --> 06:19.930
Then what are you planning to do here tomorrow?

06:20.530 --> 06:24.870
In order to live through the future, I will have to live through the present.

06:26.200 --> 06:32.520
There's a huge wall in front of me right now - a wall which I cannot get past by myself.

06:33.100 --> 06:36.440
Tomorrow, I will get past it together with her.

06:36.440 --> 06:39.540
What about how she feels?!

06:39.540 --> 06:42.910
Kazuka-kun, I beg you, don't pull Suzume into it.

06:45.510 --> 06:48.410
I need her right now.

06:48.710 --> 06:51.130
Suzume doesn't have that capability!

06:51.130 --> 06:55.390
I don't think Suzume understands what you're thinking.

06:57.680 --> 07:00.400
I really don't care what you think.

07:00.400 --> 07:03.340
However, you have to believe in Suzume.

07:04.530 --> 07:08.230
She was the one who gave me courage.

07:10.390 --> 07:14.150
I've changed after meeting Suzume.

07:15.310 --> 07:16.830
I've truly changed.

07:18.590 --> 07:22.490
However, my surroundings won't allow me to change.

07:27.800 --> 07:32.820
My past won't allow me to change, either.

07:39.650 --> 07:43.130
In the end, I had to come back to this place.

07:44.830 --> 07:47.120
I hated my own weakness.

07:48.030 --> 07:49.610
I couldn't bring change by myself.

07:50.180 --> 07:52.120
I couldn't escape this place.

07:53.360 --> 07:55.210
I pitied myself.

07:56.550 --> 07:58.490
The one whom I betrayed was myself.

07:59.220 --> 08:02.650
I destroyed all bonds with my very own hands.

08:05.750 --> 08:08.610
I thought that there wasn't anyone left in my heart.

08:09.380 --> 08:10.500
No one at all...

08:13.060 --> 08:15.750
However, I was wrong.

08:16.870 --> 08:19.430
There was still one person...

08:19.430 --> 08:21.130
Suzume was there.

08:22.360 --> 08:28.260
Her heart, and her heart alone, was connected to mine.

08:29.410 --> 08:33.360
She always held my hand tightly.

08:58.580 --> 09:01.340
Then, Suzume told me something.

09:05.300 --> 09:09.630
In order for me to be reborn, there's something I have to do.

09:14.090 --> 09:18.980
In order for me to live, there's something I have to get past.

09:22.980 --> 09:27.470
She told me that there's a place where I must go.

09:34.400 --> 09:38.610
There's a path that Suzume and I are destined to take.

09:38.610 --> 09:39.850
Path?

09:39.850 --> 09:41.840
Our future.

09:41.840 --> 09:48.200
In order to make it possible, I will have to
face my weakness one more time tomorrow,

09:48.940 --> 09:51.300
so that Suzume and I are able to continue to strive forward.

09:52.290 --> 09:55.570
Starting tomorrow, our futures will begin from this very spot.

09:56.550 --> 09:58.060
But Kazuya-kun...

09:59.210 --> 10:00.270
Don't worry.

10:00.790 --> 10:02.440
I love her.

10:18.310 --> 10:20.700
Suzume's hand, huh?

10:21.540 --> 10:24.740
My hand is bigger than a guy's hand.

10:24.740 --> 10:26.990
What guy would want to hold my hand?

10:36.210 --> 10:38.240
I finally got through.

10:38.240 --> 10:39.750
There's no time left.

10:39.750 --> 10:43.020
Girl of the Earth, lend me your power.

10:45.420 --> 10:47.650
Girl, what is your name?

10:49.870 --> 10:51.160
Yumemi...

10:52.240 --> 10:55.610
Yumemi, listen carefully.

10:55.610 --> 11:00.950
The almighty Akuto energy in my world is drying up.

11:00.950 --> 11:02.990
We're in danger of total devastation.

11:03.580 --> 11:08.170
In order to avert this danger, I need your power!

11:09.500 --> 11:11.050
Who are you?

11:12.340 --> 11:15.060
Address me as Lord Munto, not "you"!

11:16.140 --> 11:17.630
There's no time left.

11:18.370 --> 11:19.650
You've seen it already-

11:19.650 --> 11:24.080
the Heavens are falling, and will turn the Lower World into a land of death.

11:24.920 --> 11:31.570
If you don't lend me your power, both the Heavens and your world will be destroyed.

11:32.880 --> 11:35.140
Is this the same dream I always have?

11:35.140 --> 11:36.080
No!

11:36.460 --> 11:37.660
It's not a dre-

11:37.660 --> 11:38.710
Yumemi!

11:39.290 --> 11:41.630
Yumemi, get a grip of yourself!

11:41.630 --> 11:42.430
Huh?

11:42.430 --> 11:44.850
What do you mean by "huh"? Geez...

11:44.850 --> 11:49.050
I'm worried about Suzume, but I'm also worried about you!

11:50.290 --> 11:51.410
Munto...

12:38.040 --> 12:40.430
Hey, Mom...

12:40.430 --> 12:46.060
If I told you I'm going to marry some guy right now, would you allow it?

12:50.800 --> 12:52.000
Don't be mistaken.

12:52.000 --> 12:52.940
I'm just saying "if"...

12:54.060 --> 12:56.150
You have someone you like?

12:56.150 --> 12:56.960
No.

12:57.890 --> 13:00.990
Well, I think it's a bit too early.

13:00.990 --> 13:03.370
You're still a child.

13:03.610 --> 13:05.820
You should only get married when you're an adult,

13:05.820 --> 13:10.490
because then you're capable of shouldering the responsibilities and duties of society.

13:10.490 --> 13:12.880
I can't now?

13:12.880 --> 13:14.860
Can you live on your own?

13:17.910 --> 13:19.440
I think I can!

13:19.440 --> 13:20.780
No, you can't.

13:20.780 --> 13:22.380
How do you know?

13:22.380 --> 13:25.530
I know because I'm your mother, that's why.

13:25.530 --> 13:29.020
Chikara, you can't just play video games all the time.

13:39.440 --> 13:40.860
What are you doing?!

13:41.620 --> 13:44.560
Ultra Montaro is going to be on soon.

13:45.080 --> 13:46.640
Oh, that's right!

13:48.920 --> 13:50.610
Hey, Mom...

13:50.610 --> 13:54.630
So does that mean kids don't have any responsibilities and duties?

13:54.630 --> 13:56.180
Of course not.

13:56.810 --> 14:03.600
I'm just saying that you don't have enough
knowledge and experience to make the right decisions.

14:04.100 --> 14:07.530
That's why children are protected by their parents and society.

14:08.180 --> 14:10.730
So you can't say you don't have any responsibilities.

14:11.690 --> 14:14.830
I can't shoulder any responsibilities but I shouldn't be irresponsible...

14:15.450 --> 14:17.340
I don't get it.

14:17.340 --> 14:20.450
I'm just a child, so I can't understand.

14:20.450 --> 14:23.330
Don't get smart with me.

14:23.330 --> 14:25.460
Then what am I supposed to do?

14:25.460 --> 14:27.920
Study hard.

14:27.920 --> 14:31.690
Become a person useful to society.

14:31.690 --> 14:34.320
That is your responsibility right now.

14:34.320 --> 14:36.010
Have you done your homework yet?

14:41.510 --> 14:49.860
Mon-Mon-Montaro and us will still be friends on the other side of space...

14:49.860 --> 14:52.230
Smiling and...

14:54.960 --> 14:58.060
What can I do for the future?

14:58.060 --> 15:01.360
I guess it's only homework...

15:01.360 --> 15:05.390
I can't help anyone with their future.

15:05.870 --> 15:09.130
I can't even live on my own.

15:18.380 --> 15:19.550
Don't close your eyes.

15:19.930 --> 15:22.050
Don't take your eyes off of your future.

15:26.540 --> 15:29.890
Who are you? A stalking ghost?

15:30.380 --> 15:32.650
Don't say "you"! Address me as Lord Munto!

15:34.630 --> 15:37.600
I've really gone crazy now...

15:37.600 --> 15:38.750
You're not crazy.

15:38.750 --> 15:43.070
You must believe in me and in what you saw.

15:43.070 --> 15:47.280
You saw the destruction of two worlds and the extinction of two races.

15:47.280 --> 15:50.090
But the world is struggling to avoid this...

15:50.090 --> 15:53.140
...and regain the relationship that existed in the ancient past.

15:53.140 --> 15:55.500
Now, Yumemi, lend me your power.

15:55.500 --> 15:58.250
This is a dream... this is an illusion.

15:58.250 --> 16:00.350
I know you understand what I am saying.

16:01.550 --> 16:04.300
Yumemi, come on, there's no time left!

16:06.010 --> 16:07.000
Yumemi!

16:07.640 --> 16:10.680
It's not like I asked to see you.

16:11.650 --> 16:14.530
Your own future is going to be destroyed.

16:14.530 --> 16:16.850
It's not just you. It's everything!

16:16.850 --> 16:22.240
Your world will be finished unless you lend me your power.

16:22.240 --> 16:24.380
Come to me.

16:26.490 --> 16:28.540
Now, Yumemi!

16:28.540 --> 16:30.410
Shut up! I don't want to!

16:32.150 --> 16:35.040
Why must I be the one?

16:35.550 --> 16:37.990
Why can't you find someone better?

16:37.990 --> 16:40.240
I don't have that kind of power!

16:40.240 --> 16:41.840
Only you can do it.

16:41.840 --> 16:43.720
I'm trying to say that I don't know what you're talking about!

16:43.720 --> 16:45.860
Besides, you can't even touch me.

16:45.860 --> 16:48.250
How am I supposed to lend you my power?

16:50.100 --> 16:54.110
This is no good. Who am I talking to?

16:54.110 --> 16:57.980
That sky and this strange guy are my delusions.

16:58.630 --> 17:00.430
If she's not fully aware of her own abilities,

17:01.310 --> 17:03.490
then getting past the space-time continuum will be...

17:04.350 --> 17:07.210
Running away won't solve anything.

17:07.210 --> 17:11.550
In the past, our worlds were connected by the flow of Akuto.

17:11.550 --> 17:14.650
But the cycle was broken a long, long time ago.

17:14.650 --> 17:17.630
Both worlds are on the verge of destruction.

17:17.630 --> 17:20.910
In order to avert that, your power is needed!

17:20.910 --> 17:22.960
You have the power!

17:23.630 --> 17:27.490
How am I supposed to believe a ridiculous story like that?!

17:27.490 --> 17:29.020
Look around you!

17:29.020 --> 17:31.300
There's neither destruction nor devastation!

17:31.300 --> 17:33.980
Everyone is living in peace!

17:34.770 --> 17:36.950
The destruction has begun.

17:36.950 --> 17:38.930
You knew that when you saw it.

17:38.930 --> 17:41.640
You have the power to save us from that fate.

17:41.640 --> 17:44.040
You have a responsibility to the future.

17:44.040 --> 17:45.860
If you're talking about homework, I've already finished mine.

17:46.640 --> 17:49.300
I'm talking to you about the future.

17:52.450 --> 17:53.450
Future?

17:53.770 --> 17:56.120
Correct, the future of you and this world.

17:57.430 --> 18:02.130
I don't believe you or what you're talking about, but I'll listen.

18:02.480 --> 18:04.450
What can I do?

18:04.450 --> 18:06.590
Is there something I can do?

18:06.940 --> 18:09.330
Call me Lord Munto, not "you"!

18:10.720 --> 18:13.850
Tell me, Munto, what can I do?

18:16.180 --> 18:18.310
No, that's not right.

18:18.310 --> 18:21.310
Mom said you can't eat it.

18:21.570 --> 18:25.570
Montaro is a cartoon, so you can't eat it...

18:25.570 --> 18:27.730
You're so stupid...

18:48.590 --> 18:50.260
I messed up...

18:56.590 --> 18:58.390
What are you so troubled about?

19:01.400 --> 19:03.430
Do you need an exorcism?

19:03.430 --> 19:06.450
Look, Takashi's family runs a shrine.

19:09.370 --> 19:12.410
I feel bad for not being able to help you.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.350
It's Kazuya-kun.

19:29.840 --> 19:30.680
It's Suzume!

19:32.970 --> 19:34.100
Suzume!

19:43.500 --> 19:44.790
The riverbank!

20:00.370 --> 20:03.330
I lost sight of them once I arrived at the gates.

20:03.330 --> 20:04.490
About this...

20:04.490 --> 20:05.920
Yes, yes!

20:08.810 --> 20:09.460
Huh?

20:10.380 --> 20:12.510
Yes, I'll be right there.

20:13.790 --> 20:15.240
Suzume-chan...?

20:47.310 --> 20:48.470
No, not now!

20:51.940 --> 20:55.300
Not again! Stop it! I don't have time for this now!

21:00.180 --> 21:01.620
Are you all right?

21:01.620 --> 21:03.700
You don't look well...

21:03.700 --> 21:04.720
Yumemi...

21:06.760 --> 21:11.030
Lend me the power of Akuto...

21:12.490 --> 21:14.530
What exactly <i>is this "Akuto"?!</i>

21:15.040 --> 21:17.090
I've never heard of anything like that!

21:17.090 --> 21:18.260
You have to be self-conscious of it.

21:18.260 --> 21:23.640
Akuto is the power which allows you to see the Heavens and imagine things you can't see.

21:23.640 --> 21:25.120
The power which allows you to go where you want to go!

21:27.080 --> 21:28.550
I don't understand...

21:28.550 --> 21:29.750
I don't understand!

21:31.810 --> 21:35.220
Believe in your own power, Yumemi.

21:35.860 --> 21:36.340
But...

21:42.350 --> 21:43.470
Yumemi!

21:46.880 --> 21:48.280
Yumemi, hurry up!

21:52.320 --> 21:53.300
Munto...

22:00.430 --> 22:02.980
An ancient Akuto weapon.

22:02.980 --> 22:06.290
That damned Gntarl is bringing me unnecessary trouble...

22:25.100 --> 22:27.020
Lady Ryuely, this is bad!

22:27.020 --> 22:28.730
Something strange is attacking Lord Munto!

24:31.490 --> 24:34.690
Kazuya, do you like the breaststroke or the front crawl better?

24:34.690 --> 24:36.980
Let's see... I think I prefer the front crawl.

24:36.980 --> 24:39.780
Well, the producer requested the breaststroke.

24:39.940 --> 24:40.610
Why?

24:40.610 --> 24:42.830
Umm... I think it has something to do with the artwork.

24:43.460 --> 24:47.080
Next episode of The World Reflected in the Eyes of a Girl Looking Up at the Sky:

24:47.080 --> 24:48.330
Confronting.
